sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Page
    participant A as Hono API
    participant R as readWithFallback
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant PG as Local PostgreSQL (dev only)
    participant O as Developer

    P->>A: GET /api/forms/:id
    A->>R: getForm(id)
    R->>FS: primary read
    alt Firestore answers (a form or null)
        FS-->>R: form or null
        R-->>A: result (null becomes 404)
    else Firestore throws and local Postgres is enabled
        FS--xR: error (logged)
        R->>PG: fallback read
        PG-->>R: form or null
        R-->>A: result
    else Firestore throws in production
        FS--xR: error
        R-->>A: error (500)
    end
    A-->>P: 200 form, or 404

    Note over O,PG: Refresh the local copy (local only)
    O->>A: GET /api/sync/status (Bearer token)
    A->>FS: form ids and submission counts
    A->>PG: form ids and submission count
    A-->>O: missingInPostgres, onlyInPostgres, inSync
    O->>A: POST /api/sync (Bearer token)
    A->>FS: read all forms and submissions
    A->>PG: upsert forms, questions and submissions
    A->>PG: delete forms that no longer exist in Firestore
    A-->>O: forms, submissions, removed
